
Act as a Principal AI + Full-Stack Engineer.

Implement a production-ready Retrieval / MCP Foundation for the KB Admin application.

The objective is to transform the existing Knowledge Assistant into an enterprise-grade Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system that answers ONLY using approved enterprise knowledge and never hallucinates.

The implementation should be modular, scalable, and support future MCP tools.

==================================================
GOALS
==================================================

The Knowledge Assistant should:

✓ Answer questions from uploaded KB documents.
✓ Answer questions from GitHub-imported documentation.
✓ Answer questions from Markdown, PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, CSV, JSON, TXT.
✓ Search all approved KB articles.
✓ Search article metadata.
✓ Search section hierarchy.
✓ Return evidence and citations.
✓ Never invent answers.
✓ Say "I don't know" if evidence is insufficient.
✓ Support future MCP tools.

